  "instructions_to_main_agent": [
    "Strictly follow the color palette provided. Do not use generic grey or black. Stick to the deep charcoal shades and precise botanical green/amber hex codes.",
    "Implement the UI for React Native with Expo. Ensure gradients (e.g., using expo-linear-gradient) over images fade smoothly into the background colors.",
    "The 'Identify' button in the bottom navigation should be a raised, fully circular Floating Action Button (FAB) anchored to the center.",
    "For the paywall, the background image MUST take the full screen width and height. Use a dark linear gradient overlay from the bottom to ensure text readability.",
    "Never use generic placeholder images. Map the specific URLs under 'media_urls' directly to the respective components.",
    "On bird detail views, use a full-bleed top hero image that fades elegantly into the background color.",
    "Emphasize soft, colored glows behind primary interactive elements instead of harsh drop shadows. Use the provided glow colors in the 'glows' object.",
    "All interactive elements MUST have a data-testid attribute in kebab-case format."
  ]
